# SPA fallback for static hosts (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify).
#
# IMPORTANT: on these hosts, real static files are served BEFORE this rule.
# So a prerendered page like /sets/ascended-heroes/index.html is served at the
# clean URL /sets/ascended-heroes, and only routes WITHOUT a prerendered file
# (e.g. /dashboard, /card/:id, /u/:slug) fall through to the SPA shell here.
#
# This is the fix for "Discovered – currently not indexed": Lovable's built-in
# hosting ignores nested prerendered HTML and serves index.html for every clean
# URL (canonical=/ on all 20k pages). A static host that honors this file serves
# the real per-page HTML instead.
/*    /index.html   200
